<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia unchanged 1.874 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia unchanged 1.874 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia was unchanged at 1.874 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange.</p>
<p>				    November 29	  November 28</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar	  1.874		  1.874</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $5,50 million	$7,80 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
